    "detailed_description": "<strong>Hero of Not Our Time</strong> is a 2D top-down action game with elements of 90s classics. The player will have to move through neo-noir dungeons looking for a way out, simultaneously destroying various monsters using magic and weapon, cleaning up location after location.<br><br>Got home from school or... kindergarten? <strong>Highkey angry</strong>?<br><br>- Log in, killed, Log out.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>ASSEMBLE UNIQUE WEAPON SAMPLE</strong><br>A bunch of details and no customization restrictions.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409730/extras/1f37e9d018f897fa48af70098e7419b8.poster.avif?t=1628611520\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409730/extras/1f37e9d018f897fa48af70098e7419b8.webm?t=1628611520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409730/extras/1f37e9d018f897fa48af70098e7419b8.mp4?t=1628611520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li><strong>CREATE MAGIC SPELLS USING YOUR OWN BLOOD</strong><br>Spiritism and rituals will heal you and make you stronger.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409730/extras/7731692ee3f4088d144371c32756ee62.poster.avif?t=1628611520\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409730/extras/7731692ee3f4088d144371c32756ee62.webm?t=1628611520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409730/extras/7731692ee3f4088d144371c32756ee62.mp4?t=1628611520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li><strong>IMPLANT ELECTRONIC STUFF RIGHT IN YOUR HEAD</strong><br>Different chips and improvements that might be connected to your skull will make your gameplay more fun and crazy.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409730/extras/44f895fbecd441de13c49715485b534e.poster.avif?t=1628611520\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409730/extras/44f895fbecd441de13c49715485b534e.webm?t=1628611520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409730/extras/44f895fbecd441de13c49715485b534e.mp4?t=1628611520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li><strong>DISMEMBER CROWDS OF ENEMIES</strong><br>You will meet new enemies on your way, difficulty will increase over time.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409730/extras/546305325b4d55a577eace72e2b8c1b1.poster.avif?t=1628611520\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409730/extras/546305325b4d55a577eace72e2b8c1b1.webm?t=1628611520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409730/extras/546305325b4d55a577eace72e2b8c1b1.mp4?t=1628611520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li><strong>ULTRAVIOLENCE STIMULATION</strong><br>All that cruelty will be accompanied by energy EDM music in Synthwave and Darksynth genres.</li></ul>",
